---
// Where each value comes from is decided by the signature alone: one PUT
// request, three places a value can live (path, query, body).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900, H = 330;
const cards = [
  { x: 30, icon: 'link', piece: '1b68a63a', tag: 'path', why: { en: 'the name sits in the URL template', vi: 'tên nằm trong mẫu URL' }, rule: { en: 'Path(pattern): 8 hex characters', vi: 'Path(pattern): 8 ký tự hex' }, got: 'case_id = "1b68a63a"' },
  { x: 320, icon: 'search', piece: '?dry_run=true', tag: 'query', why: { en: 'a plain scalar, nothing else claims it', vi: 'một giá trị đơn, không ai khác nhận' }, rule: { en: 'Query(): optional, default False', vi: 'Query(): tuỳ chọn, mặc định False' }, got: 'dry_run = True' },
  { x: 610, icon: 'doc', piece: '{ title, priority }', tag: 'body', why: { en: 'the type is a BaseModel', vi: 'kiểu là một BaseModel' }, rule: { en: 'Draft: title 3–120, priority 1–5', vi: 'Draft: title 3–120, priority 1–5' }, got: 'title = "Stolen schema"' },
];
---
<figure class="bep3n2">
  <div class="bep3n2-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="One PUT request on /cases/{case_id}/draft has three places a value can come from. The path value 1b68a63a is checked against an 8-hex pattern, the query value dry_run=true becomes the boolean True, and the JSON body is checked against the Draft model. The function signature alone decides which is which.">
    <text x="450" y="30" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>one request: PUT /cases/{'{case_id}'}/draft?dry_run=true, with a JSON body</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một request: PUT /cases/{'{case_id}'}/draft?dry_run=true, kèm JSON body</tspan></text>
    {cards.map((c) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={c.x} y="56" width="260" height="206" rx="8" class="box" />
        <DiagramIcon name={c.icon} x={c.x + 130} y={82} size={24} />
        <text x={c.x + 130} y="122" text-anchor="middle" class="t">{c.tag}</text>
        <text x={c.x + 130} y="142" text-anchor="middle" class="m">{c.piece}</text>
        <text x={c.x + 130} y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>{c.why.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{c.why.vi}</tspan></text>
        <text x={c.x + 130} y="196" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>{c.rule.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{c.rule.vi}</tspan></text>
        <text x={c.x + 130} y="238" text-anchor="middle" class="t">{c.got}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="450" y="302" text-anchor="middle" class="rr"><tspan data-lang-en>no hint from you except the type: FastAPI reads the signature and nothing else</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bạn không gợi ý gì ngoài kiểu: FastAPI chỉ đọc chữ ký hàm</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Path, query and body are not settings you pick; they fall out of how the parameter is declared, and every value is checked on the way in.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Path, query và body không phải thứ bạn chọn riêng; chúng suy ra từ cách khai báo tham số, và mọi giá trị đều được kiểm khi đi vào.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep3n2 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep3n2-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep3n2 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep3n2 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep3n2 .t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep3n2 .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep3n2 .r { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep3n2 .rr { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep3n2 .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep3n2 .boxr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep3n2 .ghost { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .bep3n2 .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep3n2 .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep3n2 .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep3n2 .hdr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep3n2 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
